    {
      "source": "Begin creating a <code>DELETE</code> operation for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domainType</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>domainType</code></a>创建一个<code>DELETE</code>操作。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The starting domainType is used for mapping the <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> provided via <code>matching</code>. By default,\nthe table to operate on is derived from the initial domainType and can be defined there via\n<a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>Table</code></a> annotation. Using <code>inTable</code> allows to override\nthe table name for the execution.",
      "translation": "起始的 `domainType` 用于通过 `matching` 提供的 `<a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>` 进行映射。默认情况下，要操作的表是从初始的 `domainType` 派生的，并可以通过 <a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>Table</code></a> 注解在该处定义。使用 `inTable` 可以覆盖执行时的表名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
