      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"ReactiveDeleteOperation.ReactiveDelete.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core\"><code>ReactiveDeleteOperation.ReactiveDelete</code></a> interface provides methods for constructing <code>DELETE</code> operations in a fluent way.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"ReactiveDeleteOperation.ReactiveDelete.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveDeleteOperation.ReactiveDelete</code></a> 接口提供了以流畅方式构建 <code>DELETE</code> 操作的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Trigger <code>DELETE</code> operation by calling one of the terminating methods.",
      "translation": "通过调用终止方法之一来触发<code>DELETE</code>操作。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Table override (optional).",
      "translation": "表覆盖（可选）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
